    "hero_image": "",
    "intro": [
      "MIPAL (Multimodal Intelligence &amp; Physical Application Lab) is a research group within the <a href=\"https://sig.tongji.edu.cn/\">Spatial Intelligence Group (SIG)</a> at Tongji University, led by Dr. Xun Jiang. Our team is also working closely with Koala URAN Ltd. towards real-world applications in spatial intelligence. ",
      "Our research spans multimodal learning, spatial intelligence (particularly from an egocentric view), and VLM/LLM reasoning enhancement. We are also highly interested in embodied multimodal spatial perception and navigation.",
      "<span style=\"color: red;\">We are currently recruiting Master's and Doctoral students for enrollment in 2027. If you are a diligent student who enjoys multimodal research and practical robotic applications, you are highly welcome to join MIPAL and grow together with us!</span>"
    ],
